                "text": "President Trump is not telling Americans the truth.\n\nAlarm bells are sounding on the economy. His tariffs are increasing prices. Unemployment is up. Inflation is rising. Republicans in Washington have created a healthcare crisis, refuse to fix it, and are avoiding meeting with Democrats to negotiate a bipartisan agreement to keep the government open.",
